        'The Conversational Compass = Ecclesiastes 3 drawn as a diagram: Connection (Proverbs 27:17), Savoring (Ecclesiastes 3:4; Acts 2:46), Protection (Proverbs 13:3; Matthew 7:6; Nehemiah 6:3), Task (Isaiah 1:18). Most frustration is a quadrant MISMATCH — name which time this is.',
        'Airtime is group-scale "swift to hear" (James 1:19) — notice who has not spoken and draw them out (Proverbs 20:5).',
