        'Teach it forward: the next generation is losing face-to-face conversation to screens; the Body is where they should relearn it.',
        'Cross-ref L44 (Safe to Speak): these TALK moves BUILD psychological safety — asking and drawing out the quiet one (Proverbs 20:5) is how a room becomes safe to tell the truth in (1 John 4:18).',
