    // each claim... use data driven reasons"): the HISTORICAL spine is solid and
    // primary-sourced -- Sargon II's annals at Khorsabad, the "27,290" deportation
    // figure, resettlement "in the midst of Assyria" -- confirming the EVENT 2 Kings
