          answer: 1,
          explain: 'The danger isn’t music; it’s that beauty and gifting lift the heart, and a lifted heart says “I.” The covering cherub’s heart “was lifted up because of thy beauty” (Ezekiel 28:17). Keep pride out on purpose.',
