          explain: '“God is not the author of confusion... Let all things be done decently and in order” (1 Corinthians 14:33,40). Public offense gets public repair — “first be reconciled to thy brother” (Matthew 5:24) — to LOVE and restore, never to humiliate (Galatians 6:1).',
