        'God’s first care for the suicidal Elijah was sleep and food (1 Kings 19:5-8). Where might "rest and a meal" be a more spiritual next step for you than pushing harder — and why is that hard to believe?',
        'The psalmist PREACHES to his soul: "Why art thou cast down, O my soul?... hope thou in God" (Psalms 42:11). What is one feeling you tend to OBEY that you could instead bring to God and preach truth back to?',
