      "howToRun": "Prayer + the anchor (5): open in prayer and read Matthew 13:18-23 aloud, then James 1:22. | Teach the four soils (12): walk each soil in order — wayside/path, stony, thorny, good ground — naming what each heart does with the same Word, landing hard on 'the devil stole from the thorny hearts.' | Discussion (5): ask the group which soil their week most resembled and why. | Hands-on in the app (—): each person runs the private Soil Check, names one heard-but-not-done Word, and schedules one concrete act of obedience. | Send-off + solo task (3): assign one passage to STUDY (not just read) before next meeting and one thorn to pull, then close in prayer over becoming good ground.",
