    "bigIdea": "The Holy Spirit is a Person to be honored and leaned on, not a force to be used; when we live saturated in His presence and consumed in the light of Yahweh, authority flows from intimacy and humility rather than from hunting the enemy. Seek the Deliverer, and deliverance follows.",
    "inApp": "Set one unhurried block this week to simply be with the Person of the Holy Spirit — no agenda, no enemy to fight — and name Him as your Helper before you plan your day. Log it as an act of rhythm, not rush.",
