            'Yahweh — "God set the members every one of them in the body, as it hath pleased him" (1 Corinthians 12:18); He shows and bears the witness (Acts 15:8), and the Word corrects every gatekeeper: "Forbid him not" (Mark 9:39); "would God that all the LORD’s people were prophets" (Numbers 11:29). Leaders recognize, prove, and make room — anoint, not appoint',
            'Whoever founded the ministry decides who carries which gift',
