          explain: 'Even Samuel nearly chose by Eliab\'s look while David was left in the field (1 Samuel 16:6-12). "A man can receive nothing, except it be given him from heaven" (John 3:27) — and what Heaven gives makes its own room (Proverbs 18:16).',
