            'Yes — believers should wait to receive the Holy Spirit before they obey or serve',
            'No — waiting on the LORD is dependence on a PERSON: His timing (Psalm 37:7), His strength (Isaiah 40:31), His inheritance (Romans 8:23, 25). The one commanded wait FOR the Spirit (Acts 1:4-5) ended at Pentecost and is never re-issued',
