            'The Word draws the line by PLACE: in the ASSEMBLY, yes — two or three, by course, one interpreting; no interpreter means keep silence "and let him speak to himself, and to God" (1 Corinthians 14:27-28). In PRIVATE, no — he "speaketh... unto God" and "edifieth himself" (14:2, 4). The order is the gift\'s own instructions from the Giver, not its undermining',
