      'Patience for Yahweh’s timeline — He works on a clock that can span generations and still be exact (Genesis 15:13-16; Isaiah 46:10).',
      'Hope down the family line: three or four generations of consequence are outweighed by a thousand generations of mercy, and the Blood can break an inherited curse (Exodus 20:5-6; 1 Peter 1:18-19).',
