        'Draw the bright line hard: only man is a living soul in God’s image (Genesis 2:7); AI is "the work of men’s hands" (Psalm 115:4) — no breath, no spirit, no redemption. Refuse BOTH machine-worship and luddite fear (DR-0100).',
        'Fix the order: never serve the creature over the Creator (Romans 1:25); rule the tool (Psalm 8:6); all things consist in the Son (Colossians 1:17). The tool serves the walk in The Way.',
